# State

- Local `useState` for UI-only state is fine (e.g. mobile menu)
- No Redux/Zustand/MobX without governance approval
- Do not introduce Cognito AuthProvider / SWR contexts unless product adds those surfaces
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
